# `out += piece` in a loop copies the characters of the piece into a buffer on the stack, by one stub a turn that gets the buffer, the cursor and the piece and hands back the new cursor. No rope is made.
# CHECK-LABEL: loop #
# CHECK: Int64 b@[[cursor]] = Phi(
# CHECK: Int64 b@{{*}} = Patchpoint(b@[[builder]]:Register({{*}}), b@[[cursor]]:Register({{*}}), b@[[piece]]:Register({{*}}), resultConstraints = Register({{*}}:StringBuilderAppendString)
# CHECK-LABEL: end of loop
